---
import { Play } from '@lucide/astro';
---

<section class="wrap section">
  <p class="eyebrow">How it works</p>
  <h2 class="h2">From queue to leaderboard</h2>
  <ol class="steps">
    <li class="card step">
      <span class="num">Step 1</span>
      <h3>Queue up</h3>
      <p>Tap <b>Queue up</b>. Once <b>4 players</b> are in the queue, a match is created and everyone is notified.</p>
      <div class="ex"><span class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" aria-hidden="true"><Play size={16} />Queue up</span></div>
    </li>
    <li class="card step">
      <span class="num">Step 2</span>
      <h3>Match found!</h3>
      <p>Everyone has <b>30 seconds</b> to accept. A sound plays, so nobody misses their turn at the table.</p>
      <div class="ex">
        <div class="accepts" aria-label="Three players accepted, one pending">
          <span><em>✅</em>alex</span><span><em>✅</em>samlee</span><span><em>✅</em>riley</span><span><em>⌛</em>jordan</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </li>
    <li class="card step">
      <span class="num">Step 3</span>
      <h3>Play and report</h3>
      <p>Pick the winning team, then the loser's score. Got it wrong? Flag the match for a moderator.</p>
      <div class="ex"><div class="mini-score"><span class="win">10</span><span class="vs">vs.</span><span>7</span></div></div>
    </li>
    <li class="card step">
      <span class="num">Step 4</span>
      <h3>Climb</h3>
      <p>Every result feeds your OpenSkill rating. Streaks, seasons and past results stay on your profile.</p>
      <div class="ex"><div class="climb"><span>alex</span><span class="mmr">1544</span><span class="muted">(+12)</span></div></div>
    </li>
  </ol>
</section>

<style>
  .steps {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 36px 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 16px;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(240px, 100%), 1fr));
  }
  .step {
    padding: 20px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
  }
  .num {
    font: 600 12px/16px var(--font-sans);
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
  }
  h3 {
    margin: 0;
    font: 600 18px/1.2 var(--font-sans);
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
  }
  p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 20px;
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
    flex: 1;
  }
  p b {
    color: var(--foreground);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .ex {
    margin-top: 6px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding-top: 16px;
    min-height: 72px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .accepts {
    display: flex;
    gap: 14px;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
  }
  .accepts span {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 4px;
  }
  .accepts em {
    font-style: normal;
    font-size: 20px;
    line-height: 1;
  }
  .mini-score {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    font: 700 32px/36px var(--font-sans);
  }
  .mini-score .win {
    color: var(--primary);
  }
  .vs {
    font: 400 14px/20px var(--font-sans);
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
  }
  .climb {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 10px;
    font-size: 15px;
  }
  .mmr {
    font: 700 24px/32px var(--font-sans);
    color: var(--primary);
  }
</style>
